from parts/trophy-garden-office.replay
# sys-trophy-garden (decomp trophy_garden_daily_encounters.c, special_encounter.c): the same day Mr. Backlot only names
# the Pokémon; the next day (the daily flag clear) and back in the office, a second one is added (slot 1 moves to
# slot 2). The encounter in the garden is the test's (tests/integration/special-encounters).
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:PokemonMansionOffice_Text_ThereAreCutePokemon 0
advance text
until idle
+0 date 2009-03-23 12:00
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DAILY_ADDED_TROPHY_GARDEN_MON false
# Out of the office and back (VAR_MAP_LOCAL_0x0B, set with the first, is cleared by the map change).
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_MANSION"
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press down
until position 48 6
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_MANSION_OFFICE"
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 16 9
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
+0 assert text platinum:PokemonMansionOffice_Text_YouAreEnviousYes 5
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
